#
# Encoding scope: one DeepPot-SE model for the Pd-Si system trained on
# AIMD liquids (Pd82Si18, Pd75Si25) and on perfect and distorted crystals
# (Pd9Si2, Pd3Si), with reference settings, training settings and the
# validation RMSEs on 300 K crystalline AIMD structures.

